    <title>BGD015 | 2024：我的姐妹，有你真好！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676f5e6015a5fd520e2c0cd3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676f5e6015a5fd520e2c0cd3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Dec 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>十丁和吞风带着年终盘点来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从诗词歌赋谈到人生哲学，从影视娱乐聊到社会议题，在各自不同的光谱中碰撞学习，发现“原来你也这么想！”“姐妹，有你真好！”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu2DijqIDrDF51a9YTMLDUSTqgu6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期节目主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>吞风</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">0:32</a> 年度关键词：勇气和觉知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 读万卷书：再见老登文学，你好女性创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 影视娱乐：女导演女演员女主播，爱死你们了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 行万里路：这一年，步履未停</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> 钞票怎么花：爱好付费和知识付费，你是哪一种？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2785">46:25</a> 人际关系：我妈成长了，我也成长了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3612">1:00:12</a> 女权光谱：是的，她出柜了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4139">1:08:59</a> 遗憾与心愿：深刻反省后，再立新目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4510">1:15:10</a>结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：Sisters Are Doin'It for Themselves - Remastered Version</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Labour - the company</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期书影音推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>书单</span></p><span></span><p><span>《浮出历史地表》孟悦 戴锦华</span></p><span></span><p><span>《如果我们无法以光速前行》金草叶</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视</span></p><span></span><p><span>《住宅区的两个人》松本佳奈</span></p><span></span><p><span>《女子推理社》国产全女综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>《海马星球》李雯</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于不孤岛】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢每一位听众。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「不孤岛Her Island」是由两位友情长跑12年的女生十丁、吞风主持的一档播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里讨论和分享一切与工作、学习、生活相关的话题，也在社会赋予给我们的女性身份之外，探索更广袤的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>彼此真实地看见迷茫、无助、愤怒和彷徨，也紧密地给与指引、鼓励、互助和拥抱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>用眼睛看世界，用声音去记录，用心跳写感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎光临我们的小岛，祝你拥有好心情。</span></p>]]></description>
