    <title>BGD012 | 你的夏天还好吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b0868f33ddcbb53c65c759</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b0868f33ddcbb53c65c759</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 08:00:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天是个很复杂的季节，很容易烦躁郁闷、昏昏沉沉，又很容易变得热烈、原谅一切，好像风一吹来，喝一瓶橘子汽水，吃一根雪糕，一切就都好了起来。那么你的夏天过得怎么样呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期和大家一起聊聊夏天，也祝大家每个夏天都能愉快度过～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节目主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>十丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>吞风</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 导语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 夏日第一感受：热！热！热！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 恋夏人vs厌夏人，十丁和吞风的夏日大作战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">20:46</a> 不上班才是夏日消暑技巧top one</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">27:48</a> 音乐、电影、综艺，“夏日安利”请查收</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a> 今夏与往日有什么不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2567">42:47</a> “微微笑，小时候的梦我知道”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> 青春和别离是夏日关键词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3618">60:18</a> 结束语</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Summer Sweet</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：夏日漱石-橘子海</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于不孤岛】</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢每一位听众。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「不孤岛Her Island」是由两位友情长跑12年的女生十丁、吞风主持的一档播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里讨论和分享一切与工作、学习、生活相关的话题，也在社会赋予给我们的女性身份之外，探索更广袤的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>彼此真实地看见迷茫、无助、愤怒和彷徨，也紧密地给与指引、鼓励、互助和拥抱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>用眼睛看世界，用声音去记录，用心跳写感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎光临我们的小岛，祝你拥有好心情。</span></p>]]></description>
